{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06561","headline":"同王十三维偶然作十首 八 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维偶然作十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耽耽铜鞮宫，遥望长数里。\n宾客无多少，出入皆珠履。\n朴儒亦何爲，辛苦读旧史。\n不道无家舍，效他养妻子。\n冽冽玄冬暮，衣裳无准拟。\n偶然着道书，神人养生理。\n公卿时见赏，赐赉难具纪。\n莫问身後事，且论朝夕是。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}